{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type DataTag<TType, TValue, TError> = TType extends AnyDataTag ? TType : TType & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L136","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/types.ts:136"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tags "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TType"},{"type":"text","value":" (usually a query key) with a data type and an optional error type, so that APIs that\nreceive it, like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.getQueryData"},{"type":"text","value":", can infer them. A type that is already tagged is\nreturned as is."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttype","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TType"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TType"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"UnsetMarker.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UnsetMarker"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"ttype","text":"TType","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DataTag<TType, TValue, TError> = TType extends AnyDataTag ? TType : TType & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:136](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L136)\n\nTags `TType` (usually a query key) with a data type and an optional error type, so that APIs that\nreceive it, like `queryClient.getQueryData`, can infer them. A type that is already tagged is\nreturned as is.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TType\n\n`TType`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`UnsetMarker`](UnsetMarker.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DataTag\ntitle: DataTag\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DataTag<TType, TValue, TError> = TType extends AnyDataTag ? TType : TType & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:136](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L136)\n\nTags `TType` (usually a query key) with a data type and an optional error type, so that APIs that\nreceive it, like `queryClient.getQueryData`, can infer them. A type that is already tagged is\nreturned as is.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TType\n\n`TType`\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`UnsetMarker`](UnsetMarker.md)\n"}
